    "description": "October is Queer History Month and New York Comic Con! Join the Civics for All Comics Group and NYU professor Stacie Brensilver Berman, as they explore how comics like the Recognized and ICONS series can support teaching LGBTQ+ history this month!\n\nWe’ll also explore Any Questions?, a comic for educators that you can use to help your colleagues learn how to build inclusive classrooms for LGBTQ+ and gender expansive youth! Participants will receive copies of Recognized #1-3, ICONS #1, and Any Questions?.\n\nNew York State and City educators that attend this panel will receive Continuing Teacher and Leader Education (CTLE) credit.\n\nThis River Pavilion panel is open to Pro and Industry (Artist Alley, Writers Block, Press, Content Creator, Panelist, Exhibitor, and Sidekick) ticket holders only.",
