    "description": "Black Comic Lords Live\n\nThe culture. The comics. The conversation. LIVE at New York Comic Con.\n\nThe Black Comic Lords bring their signature unfiltered, entertaining, and thought-provoking conversations to NYCC for a live panel celebrating Black voices, creators, characters, and culture in comics.\n\nFrom Marvel and DC to independent comics and the next generation of creators, the Lords will discuss the stories, characters, creators, controversies, and moments shaping Black representation across the comic book industry.\n\nExpect the same energy that defines the Black Comic Lords: real opinions, comic book knowledge, humor, passionate debate, and plenty of audience interaction. No scripts. No safe takes. Just comic fans talking comics and culture with the NYCC crowd.\n\nWhether you’ve followed Black Comic Lords for years or you’re discovering the Lords for the first time, come ready to laugh, debate, learn something new, and join the conversation.\n\nBlack Comic Lords Live — where comics and culture collide.",
