    "description": "Calling all wrestlers, managers, referees and fans!\n\n· Let’s get ready to rumble in the squared circle for the 4th Annual NYCC Wrestling Cosplay Meetup! Co-Hosted by Sam Syndulla, It's Jack In The Box, Camel Clutch Cosplay, Meanstreak Matt, Dusty Tribute, and The World Wrestling Cosplayers! \n\n· We’re paying homage to the greatest wrestlers of the past,present,and future! Stop by to show off your cosplay gear, talk wrestling, film content, defend your title, and cut a promo with other superstars! We'll have group photos, a wrestling cosplay circle, entrances, and more!\n\n- Last year, WWE/NXT's Zilla Fatu showed up, so you never know who you'll see! \n\nThis year's meet up is dedicated to our friend and brother, James Hannon, an author and cosplayer known for his book, \"The Anatomy of a Cosplayer,\" his video series, \"The Board Game Sherpa, The League of Super Villains, and his cosplays of Paul Bearer and Jesse Ventura🙏 We know you'll be watching over us, \"OH YESSSSSSS!\"\n\nDate: Friday, 10/9/26\n\n· Start Time: 3:00:00 PM\n\n· End Time: 3:45:00 PM\n\n· Location: South Concourse Meetups",
