    "description": "Could you draw Kermit the Frog from memory? Can you capture the exact curve of Gonzo's nose? What would Bunsen and Beaker look like as Star Wars characters?\n\nThe Muppets and the many creations from the worlds of Jim Henson are some of the greatest in TV and film history. Come and watch as talented artists illustrate them LIVE from memory! Featuring audience prompts, unique mash-ups, and free giveaways.\n\nA perfect combination of the silliness of the Muppets with the artistry of Comic Con.\n\nFeatured artists will include:\n* Richard Michael Gomez (artist and puppet builder)\n* Dave Hulteen, Jr. (\"Sam and Friends: The Story of Jim Henson's First Television Show\")\n* Amy Mebberson (Disney, My Little Pony)\n* Louis Henry Mitchell (Sesame Workshop Creative Director)\n* Becca Petunia (ToughPigs.com)\n* Chris Smigliano (ToughPigs.com)\n\nPresented by ToughPigs.com, the premiere Muppet fan site for over 25 years.",
    "guests": [
      "Joe Hennes",
      "Richard Michael Gomez",
      "Dave Hulteen",
      "Amy Mebberson",
      "Becca Petunia",
      "Louis Henry Mitchell",
      "Chris Smigliano"
    ],
