    "description": "Join us for the U.S. premiere of “Face Thief,” of *Strange: Junji Ito’s Tales for Sleepless Nights*, a live-action anthology series based on selected stories by horror manga legend Junji Ito.\nThe event will feature an exclusive screening, a special video message from Junji Ito, and a live Q&A with director Yuta Shimotsu, an internationally recognized emerging voice in J-horror, moderated by US-based horror manga artist Gigi Murakami. \nJunji Ito will appear by video message only and will not attend in person. An announcement about official merchandise on Amazon will also be included.",
