    "description": "Want to play? Sign up in person with our Event HQ staff in the D&D area at the back of Hall 1E. We recommend stopping by as early in the day as you can for the best chance at a seat. If a session fills up, a waitlist will be available.\nLooking for something quick? Stop by the D&D area at the back of Hall 1E at any time for a quick 20–30 minute Demo running on a rolling basis. No advance signup or previous D&D experience is needed for a Demo.\nWant a little more time to learn? Our two-hour Learn to Play sessions give new players a beginner-friendly introduction to Dungeons & Dragons through actual play. Our DMs will guide you through characters, dice, combat, roleplaying, and everything you need to start adventuring.\nFor a full Learn to Play session, sign up in person with our Event HQ staff in the D&D area at the back of Hall 1E. We recommend signing up as early in the day as possible for the best chance at a seat, and waitlists will be available for filled sessions.\nCharity incentives benefiting The Trevor Project will also be available during your games. Ask your DM or stop by Event HQ to learn how you can donate and add a little extra fun to your adventure while supporting a great cause.",
